{
  "about": [
    "URL-end cases shared by notice_links.js and source-links' bare_url_spans (trim_url_end).",
    "js_urls are links from the web; ruby_url_spans are the source-links URL ranges.",
    "Both sides trim trailing punctuation and unbalanced brackets while keeping balanced parentheses."
  ],
  "rows": [
    {
      "text": "see https://x.test/path.,;:!?'\u0022 now",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/path"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/path"]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/Foo_(bar)",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/Foo_(bar)"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/Foo_(bar)"]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/a).",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/a"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/a"]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/Foo_(bar))",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/Foo_(bar)"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/Foo_(bar)"]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/a(",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/a("],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/a("]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/a]",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/a"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/a"]
    },
    {
      "text": "https://x.test/[a]",
      "js_urls": ["https://x.test/[a]"],
      "ruby_url_spans": ["https://x.test/[a]"]
    }
  ]
}
